  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 190,
      "end": 383,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 1 步：定义有序指标对集合 T={(i,j) | 1≤i,j≤2023，aᵢaⱼ≥1}，以及对角指标集 D={i | 1≤i≤2023，aᵢ≥1}。因为 aᵢ≥0，条件 aᵢ²≥1 与 aᵢ≥1 等价。每个满足 aᵢaⱼ≥1 且 i≠j 的无序指标对，在 T 中对应 (i,j),(j,i) 两个有序对；每个满足条件的对角指标仅对应一个。于是精确计数恒等式为 2N=|T|+|D|。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 385,
      "end": 520,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 2 步：对每个 (i,j)∈T 有 aᵢaⱼ≥1；全部乘积 aᵢaⱼ 均非负。故 |T|=∑_{(i,j)∈T}1≤∑_{(i,j)∈T}aᵢaⱼ≤∑_{i=1}^{2023}∑_{j=1}^{2023}aᵢaⱼ=(∑_{i=1}^{2023}aᵢ)²=10000。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 596,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 3 步：对每个 i∈D 有 aᵢ≥1，且每项非负，因此 |D|=∑_{i∈D}1≤∑_{i∈D}aᵢ≤∑_{i=1}^{2023}aᵢ=100。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 598,
      "end": 643,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 4 步：由 2N=|T|+|D|≤10000+100=10100，得到 N≤5050。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 645,
      "end": 871,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 5 步：证明取等必要性。若 N=5050，则 2N=10100，而第 2、3 步分别给出 |T|≤10000 和 |D|≤100，因而必有 |D|=100。进一步 ∑_{i∈D}aᵢ≥|D|=100，但总和只有 100，故 ∑_{i∈D}aᵢ=100；所有 i∉D 必有 aᵢ=0（非负性），所有 i∈D 则因为 aᵢ≥1、共有恰好 100 项且它们的和等于 100，所以每项都等于 1。因此原数列恰有 100 项为 1、其余 1923 项为 0。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 873,
      "end": 1017,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 6 步：证明取等充分性。反之，如果原数列恰有 100 项为 1，其余 1923 项为 0，则 aᵢaⱼ≥1 当且仅当 aᵢ=aⱼ=1。取这 100 个位置中任意两个指标且满足 i≤j，恰有 100 个对角对和 100·99/2 个非对角对，故 N=100+100·99/2=5050。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 1019,
      "end": 1107,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第 7 步：综上，对任意 2023 个满足 aᵢ≥0、∑aᵢ=100 的实数，都有 N≤5050；并且 N=5050 当且仅当恰有 100 项等于 1、其余全部等于 0。证毕。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
